       RECONCILE-ROOF-TYPE-0046.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       APPLY-VALUE-0047.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
               STRING WS-KEY-CUSTOMER DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         '/'              DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         WS-KEY-POLICY    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                         INTO WS-KEY-CHAR
               END-STRING.
